<h1>Terms of use</h1><p class="caption">Updated 18 November 2026</p>
<h2 id="information">Information and practice</h2>
<p>Stocklumo is a free stock-market research application operated by Omar Hussain Fahmi. It does not provide investment advice, personalized recommendations, brokerage services or trade execution. Charts, research tools and rankings help explore information; they are not recommendations to buy or sell.</p>
<h2 id="market-data">Market-data limitations</h2>
<p>Quotes, fundamentals, company information, news and earnings depend on Finnhub and original publishers. Data may be delayed, incomplete, unavailable or incorrect. Check each quote time and original source. A connected stream does not guarantee fresh prices. Market closures, provider access and rate limits affect updates and historical coverage. Do not rely on Stocklumo as your sole basis for financial decisions.</p>
<p>The top ticker follows selected companies. Daily spotlight selections and snapshots are not market-wide indices or rankings. Discovery ranks only its displayed company list by available USD price; a higher share price does not mean greater company value or a better investment. The overview average equally weights available spotlight percentage changes versus previous close, excludes missing prices or changes, and shows how many stocks contributed. It is not a market index; check the individual quote times. Coverage counts describe provider-listed symbols, not guaranteed quote access.</p>
<p>Historical charts need usable provider data. Session charts use observations received during this visit; one quote cannot establish a trend. Snapshot day changes compare with the previous close, not a historical period. Chart animations preserve underlying values. Decorative hero videos and illustrations are not live quotes or evidence of investment performance.</p>
<h2 id="research-tools">Screener, comparisons and earnings</h2>
<p>The screener filters a selected group, not the whole market. Comparisons use available quotes and fundamentals; currencies, units and timestamps matter. Missing values are not zero. Historical comparison needs provider access and shared dates; a latest snapshot is not a historical return.</p>
<p>Earnings dates and estimates may change; actual results appear when reported. Fiscal period ends are not announcement dates. EPS is per share; revenue uses the displayed units. Where currency is unspecified, do not assume USD or sum amounts across companies. Technical Analysis remains disabled.</p>
<h2 id="practice">Virtual portfolio</h2>
<p>Practice holdings are hypothetical and do not place trades. Enter purchase prices in each stock's currency. Valuations use available quotes and their timestamps, not purchase-date market prices. Totals stay separate by currency; fees, dividends, taxes, splits and foreign-exchange conversion are excluded. Allocation and unrealized profit/loss describe practice records, not verified investment results.</p>
<p>Historical P/L, when shared closing prices are available, covers dates after all purchases within the available one-year range. It assumes continuous holdings and is neither time-weighted nor live. Missing or restricted history remains unavailable.</p>
<h2 id="availability">Use, content and external services</h2>
<p>Provider request budgets and stream capacity are shared across visitors. Newly requested companies must be validated before streaming; limits and provider failures can delay updates and retries.</p>
<p>Market-data reads and open live streams have shared limits. When network limits are enabled, visitors sharing a network can reach a limit together. If an update is limited, wait before retrying or close an unused live tab.</p>
<p>Use the service lawfully. Do not bypass rate limits, disrupt visitors, obtain credentials or redistribute provider data beyond permitted use. Market data, news, logos and linked content remain subject to their owners' rights. Publishers, company websites and social/contact services apply their own terms. A link does not imply endorsement.</p>
<p>Hosting interruptions and provider limits can affect access. The service is provided as available, without a guarantee of uninterrupted access or accuracy. Nothing here excludes rights or liabilities that applicable law does not allow to be excluded.</p>
<h2 id="saved-data">Your saved data and backups</h2>
<p>Your watchlist, recent symbols, saved screener preset, theme and practice holdings stay in your browser. They can be lost when storage is cleared, blocked or removed, or the site address changes. Unsaved edits and session charts are not a persistent archive. Stocklumo has no server copy or automatic device sync.</p>
<p>Export a private JSON backup through <a href="/settings">Privacy &amp; backups</a>. Restore replaces the categories in the file, including clearing categories saved as empty; it does not merge records. Back up current data first. Analytics consent and motion preferences are excluded. Read the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a> for storage, providers and your choices.</p>
